WEBVTT

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:26.714
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.425
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:33.323
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.368 --> 00:00:35.695
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:48.448
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.449 --> 00:00:50.444
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:54.990
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.571 --> 00:00:58.207
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:00.358
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:03.617
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:07.779
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.314 --> 00:01:12.098
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.410
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:14.987 --> 00:01:19.124
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:21.550
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:24.599
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.223
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.224 --> 00:01:28.818
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:28.819 --> 00:01:31.337
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.338 --> 00:01:34.459
♪ Shine bright like it's
the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.537 --> 00:01:37.005
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.019 --> 00:01:38.889
♪ You hands are now ♪

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.423
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:40.771 --> 00:01:44.462
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.707 --> 00:01:49.675
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.714 --> 00:01:53.134
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:03.931 --> 00:02:05.705
It seems like a hard fight
is coming.

00:02:05.706 --> 00:02:07.043
Who are you?

00:02:07.462 --> 00:02:09.404
Get lost while you can, foolish vagrant.

00:02:09.444 --> 00:02:10.847
My name...

00:02:11.039 --> 00:02:12.692
might have passed
your ears sometime ago.

00:02:13.987 --> 00:02:14.947
Chao He!

00:02:16.292 --> 00:02:17.251
The Dongfang family?

00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:21.709
If I remember correctly, there was a
girl with the name Dongfang Qinger.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:23.667
She was tasteful.

00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:27.418
How dare you make fun of the
proud kids of Dongfang family!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:31.030
I mean her flesh was tasteful.

00:02:34.996 --> 00:02:36.676
That man is sick!

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.090
He is no difference from the monsters.

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:40.711
Which is why we must not
let him escape this time.

00:02:42.227 --> 00:02:44.107
Those men from the Dongfang family
are not weak.

00:02:44.424 --> 00:02:45.157
They might...

00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:55.469
This Spin Web is the special gift
I prepared for you!

00:02:57.859 --> 00:02:59.522
He has the Hex Talent,
run for your life!

00:03:05.165 --> 00:03:06.029
Fire Magic...

00:03:12.352 --> 00:03:14.200
That Hex Talent is disgusting.

00:03:15.174 --> 00:03:17.670
Hex Talent is vile in nature,
we need to be cautious.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.147
The men from Dongfang family
used up all their ultimate spells.

00:03:21.584 --> 00:03:23.411
With Chao He's Starchart Hex Talent,

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.078
they can be taken out
in a single blow with ease.

00:03:26.813 --> 00:03:27.460
Furthermore,

00:03:28.014 --> 00:03:31.653
this Level 3 Berserker Tarantula
is able to invade a person's mind.

00:03:32.496 --> 00:03:35.488
Those who fell into its trap
will have no ways to escape.

00:03:36.964 --> 00:03:38.557
Is there any other way to save them?

00:03:39.709 --> 00:03:42.585
Let's hope one of them has the
Mind Talent or Light Talent.

00:03:43.155 --> 00:03:45.431
-Otherwise, they are beyond saving.
-Will Thunder Talent work?

00:03:55.011 --> 00:03:58.471
If you kill us, the Dongfang family
won't let you get away with it!

00:03:59.732 --> 00:04:03.816
Not even the Holy Court can scare me.
I will not fear a mere family.

00:04:18.201 --> 00:04:19.347
Refining this Fire Spirit...

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:21.835
will gave me a chance to
advance my level of magic.

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.228
With that power,
I can do whatever I want.

00:04:41.209 --> 00:04:42.085
What is going on now?

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:44.376
The Fire Spirit doesn't
hide deep in the ground.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:47.168
When the surrounding area
undergoes dramatic change,

00:04:47.472 --> 00:04:49.845
it means the Fire Spirit is now exposed.

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:07.785
It's a Fuchsia Fire Spirit.

00:05:08.068 --> 00:05:08.922
A Fuchsia Fire Spirit!

00:05:11.051 --> 00:05:12.877
This Fuchsia Fire Spirit is pure!

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:15.152
Is he out of his mind?

00:05:15.897 --> 00:05:17.431
Anyone would get excited for this.

00:05:17.909 --> 00:05:21.346
Most Fire Spirits are red in colour,
which are the more common type.

00:05:21.899 --> 00:05:23.432
But this Fire Spirit here,

00:05:23.771 --> 00:05:26.504
is born from the nature
and it's sentient.

00:05:26.682 --> 00:05:29.469
This purplish-red
Fire Spirit is priceless.

00:05:30.674 --> 00:05:34.194
They would risk lives
even commit murder just to get it.

00:05:38.909 --> 00:05:41.174
Stay put and keep an eye out,
I am going in.

00:05:41.501 --> 00:05:42.821
You don't need me?

00:05:43.248 --> 00:05:46.101
If the Holy Court wasn't
short of manpower,

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.042
I would never let you get involved
in such a dangerous situation.

00:05:50.043 --> 00:05:51.736
Your opponent is a murderer.

00:05:51.839 --> 00:05:54.079
Bringing you here is a backup plan.

00:05:54.192 --> 00:05:57.490
You are just a student, you shouldn't
face this psychopath.

00:05:59.289 --> 00:06:00.369
Be careful.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.267
A Shadow Spike?

00:06:34.306 --> 00:06:35.826
It's a Starchart spell of Shadow Talent.

00:06:47.192 --> 00:06:48.792
Chao He, you are under arrest.

00:06:49.233 --> 00:06:51.838
A hunter is a prey himself.

00:06:52.212 --> 00:06:54.066
This is getting more interesting.

00:06:54.554 --> 00:06:56.541
You just killed another four people!

00:06:56.704 --> 00:06:59.951
A death sentence won't be enough.
Your soul should be punished as well!

00:07:00.678 --> 00:07:02.956
Perhaps you should add
another charge on my sentence.

00:07:03.482 --> 00:07:05.215
Killing an agent of Holy Court.

00:07:05.656 --> 00:07:07.754
I am not wasting my time
on a scoundrel like you.

00:07:09.202 --> 00:07:11.296
You want to take me down with that?

00:07:11.988 --> 00:07:14.574
Miss Tang Yue, don't be so naive.

00:07:25.481 --> 00:07:26.801
Did I mention earlier?

00:07:26.919 --> 00:07:30.995
The foods you had in the restaurant
are laced with my special ingredients.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.324
-That is impossible!
-Is that so?

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.966
Are you feeling thirsty right now?

00:07:44.285 --> 00:07:47.166
I know agents of Holy Court
never let their guard down.

00:07:47.412 --> 00:07:48.932
I didn't use any poison.

00:07:49.417 --> 00:07:52.417
But I did use something that
could boost your health.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.396
It's starting to show its effect!

00:08:06.377 --> 00:08:07.577
Imbecile!

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:16.393
The Holy Court tries to find out
where the Violent Spring came from,

00:08:16.803 --> 00:08:20.750
so they sent a delicate lady like you
to arrest me.

00:08:21.265 --> 00:08:25.298
But haven't you heard about that?
Other than a mage,

00:08:25.696 --> 00:08:28.283
I also excel at pharmacology.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:30.024
You scoundrel!

00:08:30.258 --> 00:08:32.129
What is going on?
What are they doing?

00:08:34.217 --> 00:08:36.070
What is happening down there?

00:08:36.308 --> 00:08:37.641
Should I make a move now?

00:08:39.289 --> 00:08:40.229
Scoundrel!

00:08:40.302 --> 00:08:42.129
I'll burn you into ashes!

00:08:48.483 --> 00:08:50.908
Phoenix Blaze, Fiery Fist!

00:08:51.121 --> 00:08:52.148
Ninth Style!

00:09:21.245 --> 00:09:23.001
Chao He is sure to be dead now.

00:09:32.481 --> 00:09:33.747
He had a magical gear!

00:09:35.566 --> 00:09:38.299
She destroyed my
Earth-lord Demon Armour.

00:09:38.796 --> 00:09:39.782
Damn it.

00:09:39.975 --> 00:09:42.188
If you hadn't made me so mad,

00:09:42.316 --> 00:09:45.783
I would never use a Hex spell on you.

00:10:05.155 --> 00:10:06.849
Fiery Fist, Sky High!

00:10:30.246 --> 00:10:33.307
He is still alive?
How many tricks does he have?

00:10:35.374 --> 00:10:36.574
Brat.

00:10:36.918 --> 00:10:39.710
Take a look at your strength
before you rush in like a hero.

00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:42.421
We are both using Fire Talent.

00:10:42.597 --> 00:10:44.317
Do you seriously think
that you can hurt me?

00:10:44.686 --> 00:10:47.059
You just became a Nebula mage
not long ago,

00:10:47.106 --> 00:10:48.252
you are no match for me.

00:10:48.371 --> 00:10:50.634
Oh no, he can sense my level.

00:10:51.891 --> 00:10:54.064
I can perish you just by standing here.

00:10:55.663 --> 00:10:57.209
Go ahead and try.

00:10:57.603 --> 00:10:59.083
But if this turns into a long fight,

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:04.163
Tang Yue will have her life force
drained like the other guys.

00:11:09.716 --> 00:11:12.036
You are using my gorgeous
teacher as a hostage?

00:11:12.324 --> 00:11:16.536
Actually I am just a coward.
I won't throw my life away so easily.

00:11:16.728 --> 00:11:19.836
How about this? I won't waste my time
trying to break through your spell.

00:11:20.107 --> 00:11:22.328
Undo your Hex Talent magic
and release her.

00:11:22.666 --> 00:11:24.026
You can have the Fire Spirit.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.187
The treasures of the Dongfang kids
will be mine.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.357
How does that sound?

00:11:30.277 --> 00:11:32.490
He isn't a decent person either?

00:11:33.876 --> 00:11:36.794
How many of his Fiery Fists
can I withstand with my Aqua Shield ?

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.457
I am not sure of it either.

00:11:39.695 --> 00:11:43.137
It's a shame to let a
beauty like her die.

00:11:43.617 --> 00:11:46.849
But my mission is accomplished as
long as I get the Fire Spirit.

00:11:48.021 --> 00:11:52.101
I bet you are getting more than just
the treasures of the Dongfang kids.

00:11:52.263 --> 00:11:55.028
So, do we have a deal?
Let's work this out together.

00:11:55.557 --> 00:11:56.597
Release my teacher.

00:11:57.629 --> 00:11:58.669
Be patient.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:02.725
I am not going to take her
with my Hex Talent just yet.

00:12:03.204 --> 00:12:05.031
After I refined this
Fuchsia Fire Spirit,

00:12:05.261 --> 00:12:07.008
you may take her with you.

00:12:08.056 --> 00:12:11.537
How do I know you won't kill her
right after you are done with it?

00:12:11.606 --> 00:12:14.289
It's takes time for a hex
to attach itself to her soul.

00:12:14.927 --> 00:12:17.387
But of course,
if there is any sudden movement,

00:12:17.426 --> 00:12:19.526
I can take her life right away.

00:12:20.265 --> 00:12:21.158
Calm down.

00:12:21.504 --> 00:12:23.771
I am a man of my word
when it comes to mutual deals.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.137
A murderer with honesty?

00:12:32.374 --> 00:12:35.659
That makes a young mage
like me feel embarrassed.

00:12:36.652 --> 00:12:37.585
What did you say?

00:12:37.829 --> 00:12:39.439
Nothing. It's just that...

00:12:39.972 --> 00:12:41.905
I don't really have to
use Fire Talent magic.

00:12:43.608 --> 00:12:46.075
I should thank you for letting me
stall you for so long,

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.417
summoning from the Starchart of
Thunder Talent takes quite a while.

00:12:49.659 --> 00:12:51.471
You have Double Talents?

00:12:52.013 --> 00:12:54.213
Lightning Bolt!

00:13:11.723 --> 00:13:13.337
Lightning Strike in an instant,

00:13:13.547 --> 00:13:14.928
simple and brutal.

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:19.008
My goodness, that Starchart magic
is awesome!

00:13:25.426 --> 00:13:27.106
Miss Tang Yue, are you all right?

00:13:28.921 --> 00:13:29.735
No.

00:13:31.094 --> 00:13:31.905
No!

00:13:32.481 --> 00:13:33.654
Stay away.

00:13:35.109 --> 00:13:37.364
Extract the Fire Spirit.

00:13:38.669 --> 00:13:41.078
No, I can refine it anytime.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.122
-Your safety comes first.
-Just do as I said and extract it!

00:13:44.459 --> 00:13:46.709
Don't tell me you have no idea
what is going on with me.

00:13:47.645 --> 00:13:50.499
Another step forward and I will
cut you into pieces!

00:13:52.042 --> 00:13:55.550
That precious Fire Spirit
will soon disappear.

00:13:55.947 --> 00:13:57.819
-Hurry up and get it!
-I can really have it?

00:13:59.142 --> 00:13:59.929
Yes!

00:14:00.884 --> 00:14:03.025
Well, take care of yourself.

00:14:03.438 --> 00:14:04.664
I am going to refine it.

00:14:04.897 --> 00:14:06.417
If you need me...

00:14:07.149 --> 00:14:07.789
Get away.

00:14:13.068 --> 00:14:14.374
Hunters and prestigious family,

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.643
and even the serial killer,

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.257
they all died for fighting
to get this Fire Spirit.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:22.637
And now this priceless treasure
is in my hand.

00:14:22.868 --> 00:14:24.527
This is my lucky day indeed.

00:15:05.744 --> 00:15:07.210
This kid got lucky.

00:15:07.751 --> 00:15:09.543
I should have handed it over
to the higher-up,

00:15:09.814 --> 00:15:11.557
if it wasn't because I can't
retrieve it right now,

00:15:11.717 --> 00:15:13.197
I would never let Mo Fan have it.

00:15:14.129 --> 00:15:17.667
However, it was a right choice
to bring him along.

00:15:18.012 --> 00:15:19.746
Things could have gone a lot worse.

00:15:32.652 --> 00:15:33.452
Wait.

00:15:37.554 --> 00:15:40.505
I must hand in their remaining gears
to the higher-up.

00:15:42.485 --> 00:15:44.045
Of course.

00:15:44.357 --> 00:15:46.111
Miss Tang Yue, are you all right.

00:15:47.467 --> 00:15:48.286
I am fine.

00:15:49.346 --> 00:15:50.399
Miss Tang Yue,

00:15:50.765 --> 00:15:53.264
Chao He's ring seems special.

00:15:53.661 --> 00:15:56.105
What is its function?
Tell me about it.

00:15:57.093 --> 00:15:57.999
I am not in the mood.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:10.040
The fire from the Spirit will
change your physical strength.

00:16:10.465 --> 00:16:12.438
Unless you encounter a Fire Spirit
with higher level,

00:16:12.667 --> 00:16:16.859
any fire damage on you
will be significantly reduced.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:18.079
OK, I got it.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.995
I thought a mage's strength
will always stay the same.

00:16:21.642 --> 00:16:23.762
If I have a certain degree
of resistance against flame,

00:16:23.855 --> 00:16:25.642
it could be the greatest life saver.

00:16:26.291 --> 00:16:28.664
If I ever run into a mage
with Fire Talent,

00:16:28.989 --> 00:16:31.189
I will basically be invincible.

00:16:31.919 --> 00:16:34.908
So, you were trying to arrest Chao He
because of the Violent Spring?

00:16:35.101 --> 00:16:36.688
the case from Bow City?

00:16:37.379 --> 00:16:39.610
The Violent Spring is a
special brew of potion.

00:16:40.115 --> 00:16:42.448
The Black Curia won't get it so easily.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.234
Not to mention they got it
in a large quantity.

00:16:44.641 --> 00:16:45.547
We suspect that...

00:16:45.958 --> 00:16:48.771
an pharmacist that went rogue...

00:16:49.213 --> 00:16:53.115
sold the forbidden potion to
the Black Curia for personal gain.

00:16:53.849 --> 00:16:55.676
I could have got a lead from Chao He.

00:16:56.485 --> 00:16:57.671
But he is dead now.

00:16:58.331 --> 00:17:01.416
Let's hope we could
find a lead from his ring.

00:17:08.325 --> 00:17:10.665
Miss Tang Yue, are you okay?

00:17:13.033 --> 00:17:15.463
Miss Tang Yue, this isn't right.

00:17:15.581 --> 00:17:18.308
You are trying to have fun,
I can understand that.

00:17:18.309 --> 00:17:20.124
But you are in a taxi.

00:17:20.863 --> 00:17:23.198
Take another peek and you die.

00:18:01.928 --> 00:18:02.608
Hey...

00:18:05.313 --> 00:18:07.986
What is this all about?
You kept doing that and it's so...

00:18:07.987 --> 00:18:09.198
It's so...

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.827
It's so tormenting.

00:18:11.112 --> 00:18:12.232
Shut it.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.459
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:18:21.464 --> 00:18:24.668
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:24.718 --> 00:18:27.696
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:27.709 --> 00:18:30.286
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:34.959 --> 00:18:37.214
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:18:37.215 --> 00:18:39.275
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:18:39.314 --> 00:18:41.429
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:18:41.464 --> 00:18:44.697
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:18:45.187 --> 00:18:48.370
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:18:48.371 --> 00:18:49.965
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:18:49.992 --> 00:18:52.632
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:18:52.633 --> 00:18:54.910
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:18:54.931 --> 00:18:57.624
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:18:57.651 --> 00:19:00.956
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:19:01.694 --> 00:19:03.005
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:19:03.049 --> 00:19:04.438
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:19:04.439 --> 00:19:06.553
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:19:07.277 --> 00:19:08.447
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:19:08.448 --> 00:19:10.723
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:19:10.724 --> 00:19:11.656
♪ As we meet ♪

00:19:11.657 --> 00:19:13.762
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:19:13.763 --> 00:19:15.263
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:19:15.299 --> 00:19:18.762
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:19:18.805 --> 00:19:20.556
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:19:20.557 --> 00:19:22.477
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:19:22.478 --> 00:19:24.658
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:19:24.679 --> 00:19:25.983
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:19:25.984 --> 00:19:29.331
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:19:29.332 --> 00:19:32.261
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:19:32.262 --> 00:19:35.728
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:19:36.264 --> 00:19:37.363
♪ Oh ♪

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:41.632
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
